<title>UK: Hypo VBG sets 100 mln Swiss franc four-year bond.</title>
<headline>Hypo VBG sets 100 mln Swiss franc four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Union Bank of Switzerland.</p>
<p> BORROWER   VORARLBERGER LANDES- UND  HYPOTHEKENBANK BREGENZ</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.50	MATURITY    25.OCT.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.25    PAY DATE    25.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  STD	 LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (K)  10</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
